Hi, friend!This is a game ready (Low Poly) model of a street billboard. You can see such constructions near the bus stops for instance. It will perfectly complement your project whether it is an action, first person shooter or a racing game with a modern city environment.
Speaking about the polycount, it is quite a low number for such a model so you can use several of them on your scene.
Total polycount: 504 faces!
NOTE 1:As it is a billboard with some media content (posters) already included, it is important to note I did them on my own and I ALLOW using them in any commercial purposes.
If you do not like the given posters you can modify this model by adding a plane with a photo you wish and place it directly on to a billboard surface.
SEPARATE MESHES:Just a billboard mesh itself in 3D file - no lamps/presentational planes/cameras/other trash
TEXTURES:Empty Billboard:

  - Albedo/Diffuse - 4K;

  - Roughness/Detail Albedo - 4K;

  - Normal Map - 4K.

Basic posters:

  - Albedo/Diffuse - 4K;

  - Roughness/Detail Albedo - 4K;

  - Normal Map - 4K.

FEATURES:

  - All of the popular file formats (FBX, OBJ, DAE, BLEND, X3D);

  - File names (textures & meshes) are simple to understand, no mess in files;

  - Multi-style design;

  - Low polycount;

  - Clean topology;

  - Realistic shape;

  - 4K PBR texture maps;

  - Royalty-free licence.

OTHER NOTES:If you have any questions/suggestions or issues with the asset, please, write that in a comment section or contact me on my e-mail: andriyandriy1956@outlook.com I am always ready to help you!
