This is the Kit with Brackets for fixing the motherboard and power supply on horizontal or vertical surfaces.
Solution for using these components outside the case, whether for mining, exhibition, ventilation or for space reasons. The motherboard is 3cm away from the surface allowing for better cable organization.
The kit also includes a dedicated support for a card connected to the PCI bus (ex: PCI Multiplier), ensuring its stability outside the case and preventing bad contact.
You will need 8 M3.5 screws for the 8 (eight) L brackets for fixing a motherboard;
Use the screws of the source itself to fix the 3 (three) source supports;
You will need an M3.5 screw for the custom PCI card mounting bracket;
No support required.
Please feel free to share the images of your print, that would be great!
Don't forget to hit like and follow us! Every week we will be posting new models for you!
3D PRINTING SETTINGSDimensions(mm): 21 x 140 x 24 mmLayer heigh: 0,2mmWalls: 2Infill: 15%Material: PLA or ABSNo support required.Printing time: ~4,5h

